<title>USA: Alpha Microsystems CFO Lowell resigns.</title>
<headline>Alpha Microsystems CFO Lowell resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha Microsystems said Tuesday that Chief Financial Officer Michael Lowell is resigning to join a local company in another industry.</p>
<p>The company said Lowell will remain until late November and be available to consult on financial results for the quarter ending November 24.</p>
<p>The company said it has been interviewing candidates for Lowell's position and intends to hire a successor to work during a transition period before Lowell leaves.</p>
<p>Alpha Microsystems provides software and service for the Internet and intranet markets.</p>
</text>
